  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine Data CoLab Phase 2: Improving COVID-19 vaccine uptake, with a view to build resilient health systems for future shocks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 of the Vaccine Data CoLab will focus on catalysing COVID-19 vaccine uptake, with a view
to build resilient health systems for future shocks. This approach moves beyond vaccine supply and
works to provide data on the specific hesitancies and access barriers communities face. This
requires moving from a global to a hyperlocal and targeted approach taking into account unique
contexts and local planning and decision making for more effective behaviour change campaigns
and vaccine strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
